note Pyamff 240f51d0 (2026-07-04), unmodified. Same C2H4 problem, 50 random_uniform starts, and convergence as the archive: hidden layers 10 7, tanh, NoScaler, one batch, ADAM learning rate 0.01, force coefficient 0, epochs_max 10000, maximum absolute loss gradient below 0.02. The release removed the SE loss, so the run uses SSE. init_model_parameters is true so a fresh model is created. mlrf0_optb.py writes force RMSE as -1 for a zero force coefficient. A start fails when the log reports Max Epoch. One harness force call is one logged epoch.
